      "value": "Upon reading the notification I received today, I realized that this ticket was still open. Please close it.\n\nItems 1 through 3 that I reported were already fixed and resolved around 2022　or early 2023; as for item 4, I am withdrawing it because I believe the current layout is actually smarter. Thank you.",
